# Input
```ts
/* should generate diagnostics */
let array = [];
array.sort();
array.toSorted();

const obj = {
	arr: [3, 1, 2],
};
obj.arr.sort();
obj.arr.toSorted();

[1, 2, 3, 10, 20, 30].sort();
[1, 2, 3, 10, 20, 30].toSorted();

```

